      "writtenOn": "2025-07-28T09:13:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, exactly.\n\nThe context is, pushing tags is disabled at Google by default. So users want to be able to create signed tags using the REST API.",
      "parentUuid": "6ea52fe4_b4d8457c",
      "revId": "e920039b4093da17efdc10ea8c1d9b52ef24ba2d",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
